OTHER COMPONENTS
php-src carries code from other projects, and this project ports or bundles some of it
(libmbfl, lexbor, timelib, uriparser, libmagic, and ports of crypt, scanf,
strnatcmp, uuencode, xxHash, MurmurHash, Mersenne Twister and libavifinfo).
Each keeps its own licence, listed with its copyright notice in
THIRD-PARTY.md and in LICENSES/. Where a component is LGPL-2.1, its source is
in this distribution and the build instructions are in BUILDING.md.

